# Misc - Time Line Battle: three 5x5 boards (timelines 0, 1 and 2), all moveable for white. Layout (1400x800): Versus
# (150,280); row 7 of the mode list (690,604); Play (808,712); Submit (841,90). Squares are clicked by name
# (`clicksq <timeline> <half-turn> <square>`), see game-standard.ui.
wait 20
click 150 250        # Versus
wait 30
click 690 604        # Misc - Time Line Battle (row 7)
wait 20
click 808 712        # Play
wait 120
capture game-battle-start
clicksq 0 0 c1       # timeline 0: the pawn on the middle file
wait 60
capture game-battle-pawn-selected
clicksq 0 0 c2       # one step forward
wait 40
clicksq 1 0 c2       # timeline 1
wait 40
clicksq 1 0 c3
wait 40
clicksq 2 0 c3       # timeline 2
wait 40
clicksq 2 0 c4
wait 60
capture game-battle-three-moves
click 841 90         # Submit
wait 90
capture game-battle-white-submitted
clicksq 0 1 e3       # a black pawn on timeline 0
wait 40
clicksq 0 1 e2
wait 60
capture game-battle-black-move
